- id: '2099499530785857604'
  text: "Upgrade your flat landing pages to interactive 3D web experiences right now\
    \ at https://t.co/RlChWqfItA \U0001F30D✨\n\nMost space and tech websites rely\
    \ on static graphics or heavy pre-rendered videos. \U0001F6D1\n\nThis entire Earth\
    \ hero isn't a video, and it isn't an image sequence. It’s an actual, real-time\
    \ 3D model running live in the browser, reacting directly to the scrollbar with\
    \ zero lag.\n\nI built this complete interactive website using AI agents without\
    \ manually writing boilerplate from scratch.\n\nThe exact tech stack shown in\
    \ the build: \n- Claude Code + Opus 5 (Terminal agentic coding & component architecture)\n\
    - Sketchfab (Real-time GLB 3D Earth model)\n- Three.js & React Three Fiber (Browser\
    \ WebGL rendering pipeline)\n- Vite & React (Zero-bloat build server)\n- Smooth\
    \ Scroll Engine (Tying camera rotation & orbital zoom to scroll progress)\n\n\
    Stop copying static SaaS templates. Start building spatial 3D web design.\n\n\
    Full workflow breakdown below \U0001F9F5\U0001F447"
