    \ hyper-immersive scrollytelling experience using Next.js and native browser APIs.\n\
    \nThe exact frontend tech stack: \n✅ React & Next.js (Core App Router architecture)\
    \ \n✅ requestAnimationFrame (60 FPS scroll choreography without GSAP or Framer\
    \ Motion) \n✅ CSS Math Functions (Dynamic scaling & native mouse parallax) \n\
    ✅ Hardware Acceleration (GPU-composited layered rendering)\n\nStop building flat,\
    \ generic finance templates. Start engineering premium interactive web design.\n\
    \nCopy my exact build prompt below \U0001F9F5\U0001F447"
